---
description: Reproducible release and provenance requirements
globs: [".github/workflows/release.yml", "scripts/**", "CHANGELOG.md", "RELEASE_NOTES_*.md", "CONTROLLED_STATUS_*.json"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Build releases only from a clean tagged commit.
- Ensure tag, package version, workspace version, release notes, and controlled status agree.
- Generate distributions, SBOM, checksums, verification output, and Git bundle in CI.
- Keep generated release artifacts outside source control.
- Preserve failed checks and withheld claims in release records.
